/**
 * @defgroup components Components
 * @brief Hardware driver components for the ski performance wearable.
 *
 * Each component wraps a specific peripheral or subsystem: IMU, BLE,
 * flash storage, force-sensitive resistor, haptic motor, LED, rotary
 * encoder, GPIO utility, and power/fuel-gauge monitoring.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup sensors Sensors
 * @ingroup components
 * @brief Sensor drivers (IMU, FSR, rotary encoder).
 */

/**
 * @defgroup storage Storage
 * @ingroup components
 * @brief SPI flash device and flash log.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup communication Communication
 * @ingroup components
 * @brief BLE GATT server for data upload.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup feedback Feedback
 * @ingroup components
 * @brief Haptic motor and LED output drivers.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup power Power
 * @ingroup components
 * @brief Battery fuel gauge and power statistics.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup utilities Utilities
 * @ingroup components
 * @brief GPIO wrapper and common helpers.
 */
